Package: libgrpc-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libgrpc55 (= ${binary:Version}), libupb-dev (= ${binary:Version}), pkgconf, zlib1g-dev, libssl-dev, libabsl-dev (>= 20260107.0), libc-ares-dev, libre2-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: libgpr1-dev, libgpr2-dev, libgpr3-dev
Description: high performance general RPC framework (C development)
 A modern, open source remote procedure call (RPC) framework that can
 run anywhere. It enables client and server applications to communicate
 transparently, and makes it easier to build connected systems.
 .
 This package contains the headers and the static library for libgrpc55 .

